        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "5262509d-7172-5f52-83a3-2bb69b792bcd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Sara Carbonero, Iker Casillas\n- Roles: sports journalist, TV presenter, goalkeeper\n- Companies: Telecinco, Futebol Clube do Porto\n- Places: Spain, Oporto, Portugal\n- Concepts: nicknames, goalkeeping abilities\n\nFacts:\n- Sara Carbonero Arévalo was born on 3 February 1984 and is a Spanish sports journalist.\n- Since early 2000, Sara Carbonero was a TV presenter for Telecinco.\n- In July 2015, Sara Carbonero moved to Oporto in Portugal when her husband Iker Casillas joined Futebol Clube do Porto.\n- Iker Casillas was nicknamed \"San Iker\" (\"Saint Iker\") because of his ability to produce spectacular saves.\n- Iker Casillas is an athletic goalkeeper known for quick reactions and outstanding shot-stopping ability.",
